<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hi&nbsp;</span></font><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you again for your interest in a graduate degree program in Arizona State University’s <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/">College of Health Solutions</a>. As your admission representative, I can discuss with you the details of the program, including the curriculum, program format, tuition and more.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">At this time, your admission <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp">application</a> is incomplete. To guide you along the application process, let’s schedule an appointment to create a submission date timeline. Are you available this Wednesday afternoon?</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">If you have further questions, please feel free to email me at your convenience. &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">{!User.Email}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>